WEBVTT

00:14.130 --> 00:15.920
Send rescue immediately!

00:16.330 --> 00:18.710
Find even just one more survivor!

00:18.710 --> 00:19.210
Yes, sir!

00:19.420 --> 00:22.130
Don't let the death of the
Captain of the Knights be in vain!

00:22.540 --> 00:26.000
Was that really "the Untouchable Knight"?

00:27.420 --> 00:32.670
How pathetic for a captain of the knights
to die doing this sort of thing...

00:32.960 --> 00:33.920
He...

00:34.460 --> 00:37.080
Rodrick... The Captain of the Knights...

00:37.460 --> 00:41.420
He fought until the bitter end
so the new recruits could escape!

00:41.500 --> 00:50.080
Oh? But that death is nothing to brag about,
the new recruits ended up dying too.

00:50.330 --> 00:58.790
Well, we can always recruit new knights for the ones
we lost, and you can be the next captain, can't you?

00:59.210 --> 01:04.500
Let's just call this incident the fault of
a foolish captain and be done with it.

01:08.170 --> 01:13.330
That's what that woman looked at me
and said before the cliff collapsed.

01:14.250 --> 01:15.880
This is so unfortunate.

01:16.500 --> 01:19.670
Did she know about that?
Did she know that this is how my father would die?

01:20.040 --> 01:22.290
Damn you!

01:25.000 --> 01:31.080
Treating the knights, treating my father,
like they're all expendable...!

01:31.630 --> 01:35.130
Am I going to stand for this? Of course not!

01:35.960 --> 01:38.790
How can I avenge my father?

01:39.330 --> 01:41.330
Can I interrogate that woman?

01:41.830 --> 01:47.130
I'm not even a knight, and I can
only meet that woman from a distance.

01:47.670 --> 01:52.750
There's no way good-for-nothing trash
like me can become a knight.

01:53.290 --> 01:57.380
However, if it weren't me, but my father...

01:58.580 --> 02:00.250
I can become my father!

02:00.960 --> 02:03.960
I can do away with my own existence
and completely become my father.

02:04.460 --> 02:08.540
If I train and act like my father,
I'm sure I can become him.

02:10.210 --> 02:15.170
I'll become a knight, and that woman who
brought disgrace upon my father's death...

02:17.880 --> 02:21.500
I will make sure I bring her to justice with my own hands!

02:36.540 --> 02:37.750
Vice Captain Clark!

02:38.790 --> 02:40.630
What's happening?! Did you find him?

02:40.630 --> 02:42.290
Well no, but...

02:43.830 --> 02:45.170
What is that?

03:01.630 --> 03:03.460
There it is! The sky!

03:04.790 --> 03:05.960
I can't believe it...

03:06.210 --> 03:08.420
you've actually saved me.

04:44.540 --> 04:48.460
<b>"The Worst Princess and the Young Man's Vow"</b>

04:44.880 --> 04:45.880
Captain!

04:46.210 --> 04:47.750
I'm so glad to see you safe!

04:48.580 --> 04:54.000
This is great! We knights would be... so...

05:01.580 --> 05:06.170
Someone, hurry and put the handcuffs
for special ability users on that man!

05:05.170 --> 05:06.170
Damn it.

05:07.080 --> 05:13.170
If you have none on hand, request some from Stale.
After that attend to the Captain's injuries.

05:13.460 --> 05:17.290
Then, I'd like to send communications
to the war council office.

05:17.580 --> 05:20.380
Captain... Who in the world is that girl?

05:24.330 --> 05:29.250
She's our country's first princess,
Her Highness Pride Royal Ivy.

05:35.210 --> 05:39.790
Eh, what?!

05:40.210 --> 05:41.210
Reporting in!

05:41.420 --> 05:46.290
The wounded of our country consist of
all of our new recruits and our Captain,

05:46.540 --> 05:48.580
and the number of casualties is... zero!

05:48.830 --> 05:51.130
Hooray!

05:58.710 --> 06:00.170
It's all right now.

06:05.580 --> 06:08.500
Rodrick... Thank goodness.

06:12.920 --> 06:14.210
I couldn't protect her.

06:15.380 --> 06:19.670
Even though I was so determined to follow
through on my vow I made three years ago...

06:20.790 --> 06:26.500
All I can do is send her out to the battlefield right now.

06:27.960 --> 06:33.750
Damn it! That's the princess?!
How the hell's a monster like that a princess?!

06:34.080 --> 06:35.710
Hey, watch your mouth.

06:35.710 --> 06:39.080
Well you lot haven't seen how monstrous she can be!

06:45.000 --> 06:46.250
Get a move on.

06:48.000 --> 06:52.250
Your Highness, First Princess Pride.
I'll see you off to the castle.

06:52.920 --> 06:56.380
The vanguard is coming to meet you, so this way please.

06:56.630 --> 07:00.210
No, you are more wounded than I am, so you leave first.

07:00.460 --> 07:04.040
I'll be going soon after you. Please, come this way.

07:04.420 --> 07:07.580
In that case, have the other
new recruits go on ahead of us.

07:08.040 --> 07:12.540
As you see, I am uninjured.
So please, give the wounded priority...

07:15.960 --> 07:20.210
Captain?! Please, put me down! You're injured!

07:20.210 --> 07:23.630
There are a mountain of things
I'd like to discuss with you.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.460
A mountain of things.

07:29.250 --> 07:30.290
Scary!

07:30.290 --> 07:32.920
No doubt, he's definitely upset with me!

07:37.170 --> 07:39.170
No one look!

07:40.170 --> 07:41.790
Okay, I understand! I understand!

07:42.000 --> 07:45.080
I'll do as you say! Now let me down!

07:45.670 --> 07:50.000
No, before that, my clothes! A-and my legs are exposed!

07:52.500 --> 07:55.380
Someone... my clothes...

08:04.210 --> 08:05.420
How mean!

08:05.420 --> 08:12.790
Sure, I'm just an 11-year old kid with no sex appeal,
but I'm the first princess! Of course I'm embarrassed!

08:12.960 --> 08:16.040
Perhaps I'll nab everyone here for treason!

08:20.710 --> 08:22.750
For now, we will return to the palace.

08:23.290 --> 08:27.080
We have plenty of things we must
both discuss about this incident.

08:27.460 --> 08:31.500
I would appreciate it if you could coordinate
with Clark to schedule a meeting.

08:32.170 --> 08:35.210
All right. I'll see you at the palace.

08:37.040 --> 08:38.920
We have the room to ourselves now.

08:39.170 --> 08:45.000
The people currently present are you, the knights,
and the son of the Captain of the Knights.

08:45.330 --> 08:47.290
Also, my siblings and I, and that's it.

08:48.000 --> 08:50.080
This is not a public space.

08:50.380 --> 08:52.580
If there is something you would like to say to me,

08:52.580 --> 08:56.080
only here will you not be rebuked,
no matter how improper the remark.

08:56.880 --> 09:02.540
It seems the incident where I went to the battlefield
has been kept secret. Thank you for that.

09:02.960 --> 09:03.750
My pleasure.

09:04.380 --> 09:07.960
Now then, with all due respect, Your Highness...

09:08.290 --> 09:11.830
Where did you get your experience
using a sword and a gun?

09:12.040 --> 09:17.080
I learned a little bit about the sword and self-defense
every time Stale received instruction from a teacher.

09:17.460 --> 09:18.750
As for the gun...

09:18.750 --> 09:22.460
When I observed the knights yesterday
I saw them doing shooting drills.

09:22.920 --> 09:24.250
She's kidding, right?

09:24.250 --> 09:27.790
You learned those maneuvers
from just watching like that?!

09:27.790 --> 09:30.460
Do you mean to say that was
the first time you'd done any shooting?

09:30.460 --> 09:31.540
Unbelievable.

09:31.960 --> 09:33.290
Then at that time...

09:33.670 --> 09:38.420
how did you know that attacker was
a special ability user from our nation?

09:39.460 --> 09:42.710
If you don't want to die then use your special ability.

09:45.080 --> 09:53.290
I foresaw it. I saw him build a wall of dirt with his ability
in the middle of the rockslide to protect himself.

09:53.920 --> 09:56.460
I absolutely cannot tell them the truth.

09:56.460 --> 10:00.630
I can't tell them that I knew the last boss
cheat since it's a route in the game.

10:01.250 --> 10:05.210
Why did you arrive unattended?

10:05.630 --> 10:09.960
Was it not possible to alert the new recruits
and the vanguard and then move?

10:10.250 --> 10:13.920
The new recruits had already fled to safety
and were away from that location.

10:14.380 --> 10:19.500
Also, due to the limitations of Stale's powers,
I was the only one who could rush to the scene,

10:19.830 --> 10:22.790
and I was the only one who would
recognize the special ability user.

10:22.790 --> 10:26.790
But even so, it is far better than
you coming to the battlefield!

10:28.040 --> 10:33.460
Even if no one else could have made it in time!
You should not have been there!

10:33.460 --> 10:35.040
Hey, calm down!

10:35.250 --> 10:40.830
You should have alerted the vanguard of
the man's characteristics and then left the rest to us!

10:41.460 --> 10:46.630
Then in the worst case scenario, you and maybe
even that man would be caught in the rubble.

10:46.920 --> 10:48.380
I am most certain that-

10:48.380 --> 10:49.880
We are knights!

10:50.380 --> 10:53.750
We are the sword and shield that
protect Her Majesty the Queen,

10:53.750 --> 10:57.250
His Majesty the Prince Consort,
the people of our country, and also you!

10:57.880 --> 11:02.750
If it is for you or our countrymen,
we will gladly give our lives!

11:03.960 --> 11:07.420
Not only did you almost bring disgrace
upon the way of the knights,

11:07.750 --> 11:11.880
you almost brought despair upon
every person in this country!

11:17.330 --> 11:19.210
He makes a good point.

11:19.670 --> 11:22.290
What he wished for was a knight's honorable death.

11:22.880 --> 11:29.330
Not only would I have died there had I taken one wrong
step, but his death would have been in disgrace.

11:31.080 --> 11:32.080
But...

11:38.210 --> 11:41.580
The value of your life is completely different from ours!

11:42.460 --> 11:45.250
Do you know how much of a loss your death would be?!

11:45.630 --> 11:48.880
You absolutely should not act for our sake!

11:49.380 --> 11:50.580
Refrain from doing so!

11:50.580 --> 11:56.420
Even if I am Captain of the Knights,
you risking your life is not worth saving mine!

11:56.830 --> 11:58.040
Silence.

12:04.830 --> 12:05.830
Silence.

12:09.670 --> 12:12.500
What you say is true, Captain.

12:13.210 --> 12:17.750
I caused trouble for many people with my hasty actions.

12:18.250 --> 12:21.920
I tried to save you in a way you didn't want me to.

12:22.880 --> 12:23.750
However,

12:27.000 --> 12:30.080
you are not the only one I rescued!

12:30.670 --> 12:33.420
I saved the knights that will soon
be under your leadership!

12:33.920 --> 12:37.000
And how many people do you suppose
those knights will save down the road?!

12:37.380 --> 12:43.290
You knights protect the people directly,
and you are our rays of hope!

12:43.830 --> 12:50.330
Just how many people will die in the future due to
the loss of a single knight who could have saved them?!

12:51.000 --> 12:55.880
If you call yourselves "knights", rather than
fussing about not being able to die with honor,

12:56.080 --> 13:00.380
worry about your fellow countrymen that will die
in the future because you're not there to save them!

13:00.790 --> 13:05.080
You also don't understand
the value of your own life, Captain.

13:05.710 --> 13:12.750
How much do the people around you adore,
love, and devote their hearts to you?!

13:15.580 --> 13:19.880
Even if you weren't Captain of the Knights
and just a mere soldier,

13:20.290 --> 13:23.210
I would have done the same thing I did, without a doubt!

13:29.750 --> 13:32.210
The moment I know I can save someone, I must do so!

13:32.580 --> 13:36.250
You are all knights as well as the people of my country!

13:36.710 --> 13:41.500
I am the First Princess, and the
first in line for the throne of this land!

13:41.920 --> 13:44.380
I am someone who lives for the sake
of the people of this country!

13:44.880 --> 13:48.380
As such, I will not allow any sort of needless death!

13:56.500 --> 14:01.830
I told them they wouldn't be rebuked no matter what,
but I've had a comeback for everything he's said...

14:03.710 --> 14:09.960
Last of all, about imposing myself on you all
and causing all of that trouble...

14:10.500 --> 14:14.880
As the first princess, I apologize to you
from the depths of my heart.

14:15.710 --> 14:17.580
Please accept my sincerest apology.

14:21.920 --> 14:24.080
Your Highness, First Princess Pride.

14:25.330 --> 14:30.830
If this is truly an unofficial space, may I say something?

14:31.130 --> 14:32.210
Go ahead.

14:32.500 --> 14:38.000
As a knight, I do not approve of the royal family
getting involved in this incident.

14:38.500 --> 14:42.670
However, personally, this is what
I would like to say here and now.

14:43.250 --> 14:51.460
Thank you for saving the knights from our dilemma,
with the assistance of Prince Stale's powers.

14:51.460 --> 14:52.420
Whoa now, Clark...

14:52.420 --> 14:53.460
In addition!

14:55.330 --> 15:01.040
My friend... Thank you for saving Rodrick,
Captain of the Knights!

15:02.080 --> 15:07.380
Without your actions, we may well
have lost our precious friend.

15:09.290 --> 15:17.540
We appreciate you saving our Captain after
our inexperience put him in danger.

15:18.170 --> 15:20.000
Please allow me to give you my thanks!

15:20.000 --> 15:21.040
And mine as well!

15:21.460 --> 15:22.670
Thank you!

15:22.670 --> 15:25.670
Thank you for saving the Captain!

15:26.000 --> 15:27.250
We appreciate you!

15:33.880 --> 15:38.210
My dad... Thank you for saving my father.

15:40.580 --> 15:43.460
Um... Is it okay if I speak too?

15:43.630 --> 15:44.420
Son...

15:44.420 --> 15:46.500
Yes, please go ahead.

15:48.250 --> 15:55.500
I'm... a special ability user. However, since
it's not an ability fit for a knight or anything really,

15:56.380 --> 16:04.830
I am a useless person who didn't want to bring shame
upon my dad and gave up on becoming a knight.

16:06.670 --> 16:10.170
But at that time, when I thought my father would die...

16:12.000 --> 16:15.040
I regretted that I couldn't do a thing.

16:16.330 --> 16:22.580
From here on, I will train much harder.
I will undertake my father's training and improve.

16:23.040 --> 16:29.710
So, do you think I can become one too?
Can I become an honorable knight like my father?

16:30.080 --> 16:31.210
Even if I start now?!

16:39.040 --> 16:40.080
You can.

16:42.210 --> 16:47.130
Even if everyone in the world says you can't,
you will have my support.

16:47.790 --> 16:54.330
You can become an honorable knight,
just like your father.

16:55.080 --> 17:02.960
After all, you have the kindness to weep
for your family, and such fine hands.

17:04.250 --> 17:09.460
Besides, you want to become strong, don't you?

17:13.000 --> 17:14.540
Let me see your face.

17:15.540 --> 17:21.000
When you have become the knight
you aim to be in the future,

17:21.580 --> 17:26.960
please protect the countrymen you love,
and my precious family as well.

17:31.790 --> 17:32.920
I will!

17:33.920 --> 17:39.170
Whether it takes a year or even tens of years,
I'll become a knight! And then...

17:39.460 --> 17:42.880
Please! Let me protect you for my entire life!

17:43.880 --> 17:45.170
Protect me?

17:55.290 --> 17:57.080
What's your name?

17:57.750 --> 18:00.750
Arthur. Arthur Bersford.

18:01.040 --> 18:02.080
Arthur...

18:04.670 --> 18:09.040
This Arthur is... Captain Arthur, the love interest!

18:09.670 --> 18:13.290
That's right, he was the
Captain of the Knights in the game!

18:13.290 --> 18:18.920
The strongest knight and the only love interest who has
the sword skills to overpower the last boss, Pride!

18:19.500 --> 18:22.040
And on top of that, his special ability...

18:23.080 --> 18:28.920
I can't believe the son of the Captain of the Knights
is a love interest... But...

18:30.130 --> 18:34.790
Arthur, you will surely make good on your promise soon.

18:35.420 --> 18:37.130
I just foresaw it.

18:37.670 --> 18:40.880
In the near future, you will become an honorable knight.

18:41.290 --> 18:45.000
A strong knight that not only I,
but everyone will recognize.

18:45.250 --> 18:46.080
Huh?

18:46.380 --> 18:48.500
I look forward to it, Arthur.

18:48.670 --> 18:49.580
And also,

18:58.000 --> 19:04.420
if you ever feel that I am the enemy of the people
of this country, do not hestitate to slit my throat.

19:06.250 --> 19:06.710
What are you...

19:06.710 --> 19:12.630
It's all right. That last part is not a premonition.

19:16.460 --> 19:18.670
Your Highness, First Princess Pride.

19:24.420 --> 19:25.830
On this occasion...

19:26.830 --> 19:31.420
I thank you for saving my life.

19:33.830 --> 19:40.460
My friends, my subordinates, my family...
I'm overjoyed to be able to see them again!

19:41.670 --> 19:48.540
More than anything... my son...
to hear those words... he will become a knight...

19:50.790 --> 19:53.500
I'm so glad... I'm alive!

19:56.750 --> 20:02.290
Wonderful. It's wonderful you're still alive!

20:10.710 --> 20:14.330
If you ever feel that I am the enemy
of the people of this country...

20:15.710 --> 20:18.500
Why did Princess Pride say that?

20:19.040 --> 20:24.420
She did say it wasn't a premonition...
But there's no way for me to know for sure.

20:25.040 --> 20:26.170
But...

20:26.960 --> 20:31.420
Even if the whole world becomes
your enemy, I want to protect you.

20:31.960 --> 20:39.250
So that you always stay on the right path, and to make
sure you aren’t forced to go down the wrong one,

20:39.750 --> 20:46.040
so your noble mind isn't sullied,
and that resilience of yours is not worn away.

20:46.920 --> 20:50.920
And also, so I absolutely will
not stray from the right path...

20:52.170 --> 20:59.460
those who sully your own path, those who attempt to
deceive you, those who stand in your way, all of them...

21:01.880 --> 21:05.000
I will make sure I cut them down myself.

21:09.290 --> 21:14.170
And if you... if you seem like
you're going to fall apart, that's when...

21:15.830 --> 21:18.290
The moment I know I can save someone, I must do so!

21:20.540 --> 21:26.210
I will do everything possible to save you.
Just like I was saved by you today.

21:27.040 --> 21:30.880
No matter the predicament, I will help you.

21:31.580 --> 21:33.830
Just like you did for me today.

21:35.330 --> 21:40.420
I swear it to you on the name Arthur Bersford,

21:41.330 --> 21:43.380
I WILL become a knight!

21:44.170 --> 21:46.960
And I will protect her.

21:48.000 --> 21:53.000
For her, I will give my everything.

23:29.000 --> 23:33.830
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:34.630 --> 23:37.750
Episode 5: "The Wicked Princess and the Sword".

23:36.380 --> 23:41.040
<b>"The Wicked Princess and the Sword"</b>
